---
import Policy from '../layouts/Policy.astro';
import { contact } from '../data/site.js';

const updated = 'October 22, 2026';
---
<Policy
  title="Terms of Service | GENCI"
  description="GENCI's terms for the free sample edit and the Visual Growth and Lead Engine plans: billing, ad account access, ad spend, setup fee, results and cancellation."
  heading="Terms of service"
  updated={updated}
>
  <section>
    <h2>These terms</h2>
    <p>
      These terms cover GENCI’s free sample edit and our monthly plans, Visual Growth and Lead Engine. By ordering a
      plan, you agree to them. Questions go to <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> or
      <a class="nobr" href={contact.tel}>{contact.phoneDisplay}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What each plan includes</h2>
    <p>
      Each plan includes what is listed in our <a href="/#pricing">pricing</a> when you sign up. The free sample edit
      is one 30-second video and does not include rounds of changes. Every video in a plan gets 3 rounds of changes
      before final delivery.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Billing</h2>
    <p>
      Plans are billed monthly, in advance, in US dollars. Your GENCI fee covers the videos and, on Lead Engine, the
      management of your ads.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Your ad account</h2>
    <p>
      On Lead Engine, you own the Facebook and Instagram ad account and the card that pays for it. GENCI joins your
      Meta Business Manager as a partner to set up and manage your campaigns. GENCI never pays or advances ad spend on
      your behalf.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Ad spend</h2>
    <p>
      You pay for your ads directly to Meta, with your own card. Ad spend is separate from your GENCI monthly fee and is
      not included in any plan price.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Lead Engine setup fee</h2>
    <p>
      Lead Engine has a one-time setup fee of $297. It is not refundable once we have started setting up your account
      and campaigns.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>No guaranteed results</h2>
    <p>
      We do not guarantee a number of leads, a number of sales or a cost per lead. What we guarantee is the work
      described in your plan. On Lead Engine, that means new videos every month, weekly checks of your ads and weak ads
      replaced with new versions.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Cancellation</h2>
    <p>
      Plans are month to month, with no long-term contract. You can cancel anytime before your next billing date by
      emailing <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a> or texting
      <a class="nobr" href={contact.sms}>{contact.phoneDisplay}</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      When you cancel, the ad account, the ads and every video we delivered stay with you.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>When these terms change, we will post the new version on this page with a new date.</p>
  </section>
</Policy>
